#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname dołącz: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Program system: command.
Program chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename dołącz: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Plik nowy: filename, pisz: ['sometext'].
{ Plik lista: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Wyjście pisz: ['no crash'], nowa-linia.

